          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the day Moses finished setting up the Tent of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s presence, he anointed and dedicated the Tent and all its equipment, and the altar and all its equipment. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the clan chiefs who were leaders in the tribes of Israel, the same men who were in charge of the census, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "brought their offerings to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": six wagons and twelve oxen, a wagon for every two leaders and an ox for each leader. After they had presented them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Accept these gifts for use in the work to be done for the Tent; give them to the Levites according to the work they have to do.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses gave the wagons and the oxen to the Levites. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He gave two wagons and four oxen to the Gershonites, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and four wagons and eight oxen to the Merarites. All their work was to be done under the direction of Ithamar son of Aaron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Moses gave no wagons or oxen to the Kohathites, because the sacred objects they took care of had to be carried on their shoulders.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:9"
