        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The leaders also brought offerings to celebrate the dedication of the altar. When they were ready to present their gifts at the altar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Tell them that each day for a period of twelve days one of the leaders is to present his gifts for the dedication of the altar.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
